{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"He waves back to Rockman, with a nod to Heki, taking a seat at the bar.","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:39:07.914000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746408055046012948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Heki finds a bottle of mead and serves it to ♪ \"So after today, I am likely leaving this island for a long time.  This pub is a place that all are welcome, and as such, I have tried keeping mostly unaffiliated in my time here.  It needs someone to tend to it, someone good at listening, and someone that is good at doling out the advice people need to hear, instead of what they want to hear.  So when I am gone, will you make this place yours, and tend to this bar as I have?\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:41:10.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746408569720668310","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"He blinks once, sort of frozen in the act of refusing the mead.\n“...isn’t it weird to run a bar if you don’t eat?”","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:42:09.905000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746408818371461228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Rockman gulps the coffee and takes a deep breath. He drops a bag of 200gp on the counter and leaves.","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:43:06.937000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746409057581269073","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"laughs \"I rarely eat, as I consume most of my calories through drinks.  But as a bartender, it about helping the people, listening.  My way is to join them, but you can find your own way.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:43:30.682000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-21T16:46:22.063000Z","id":"746409157175017474","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Heki quickly picks up the 200gp \"People come here, needing to talk through their troubles, find friends, discuss matters of love and loss.  They need an unbiased ear, and a few well placed words to help them.  That is all you'd have to really do.  Keep their cups full, and their minds uncluttered.  I know few people that have that in them.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:45:57.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746409772223561739","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"♪’s eyes wander around the pub.\n“...I’d need some help. I doubt I could stay in one place for so long, even if that’s just behind the bar.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:46:59.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746410031960031242","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Well Baeshra is the cook here, and I suggest you bring some friends in to help build it how you imagine it.  But ultimately, youd be the one people seek\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:47:56.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746410270091509760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"He raps his talons on the bar idly, letting out a little huff of air in silent laughter.\n“You know, reason I came here is that too many people sought me.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:51:35.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746411191726768309","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“But,” he continues, a slight smile growing on his features, “with a few friends, I bet I could manage.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:51:58.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746411285075460216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
