{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Heki holds out his hand \"I trust this bar in good hands\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:52:54.344000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746411521344667728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"He shakes Heki’s hand firmly.\n“Could I ask where you’re headed?”","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:54:15.634000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746411862299639900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Bardic enclave in Sylvania, on the edge of the Outlands\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:55:15.858000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746412114897403986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“Maybe I’ll visit,” he says as he <:thonking:736065749688385618>.","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:56:51.135000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746412514518237305","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Its quite a party there, though It can be difficult to get to.  If you do visit, look me up\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:57:46.845000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746412748182650910","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"♪  nods once, leaning on the counter and again looking around the pub.\n“Anything I should know?”","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:01:10.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746413602424225943","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Give everyone a chance.  If someone comes in here, assume they need help.  Yesterday Soloman came in, and I treated him humanely, and he now might give us aid tonight.  This is why I think its important that the barkeep not be affiliated with any group.  Don't let bias affect how you treat people here\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:03:01.522000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746414068033912862","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"And dont let others do so\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:05:06.350000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746414591600492625","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"He tilts his head somewhat.\n“I’ll keep that in mind, but I’m going to have to put my foot down at some point.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:08:22.814000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746415415630102528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I mean, I told Soloman and John off in the same breath.  You have to put your foot down a lot, but it needs to be to help settle conflict, or squelch it.  If someone cannot be respectful to you, kick them out.  But this has to be seen as neutral territory, and a safe haven.  Or find your own way, but I picked you because I believe you are the best person for this\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:10:31.615000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746415955860652143","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"♪  nods once.\n“Thank you.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:13:12.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746416630514581584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"No, Thank you.  I wouldn't feel right without someone to step into my place here\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:13:38.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746416739570417805","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“I hope your travels treat you well, then.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:16:47.129000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746417530880655370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
