{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Lilia waves back and also gives Heki a smile","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:20:09.929000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746418381485244426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Ready for today?\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:20:18.140000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746418415924936754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“Probably. I need to check if Wren has more magic arrows.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:20:45.348000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746418530043429016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"She nods \"I've prepared a bunch with healing, I'll be surprised if I even get a chance to hit it. I'll probably not even use a few of the magic stuff I have.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:22:38.034000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746419002682769430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Hello Lila, how fair you today?\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:23:42.140000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746419271562690574","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"“Your healing is pretty handy,” he says, running a hand over part of his wing that maybe wouldn’t be there without it.","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:24:07.657000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746419378588745888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Heki begins setting a few glasses out so they are ready for people","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:24:17.648000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746419420494168095","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"As well as I can be. Weird thing about following the Goddess of death is that I don't really have issues about dying even if I want to live.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:25:33.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746419737868894319","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I fear losing people more than death.  This is why I make people live on as stories.  No matter how today goes, you all will be immortally remembered as myth and legend\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:27:17.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746420174705655899","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"I hope you are proud of your journey.  A year ago, you had almost nothing.  A week ago you were ready to walk out on this town.  Today you are the only leader they care to follow.  Sounds like you have embraced the hero within.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T17:28:45.373000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746420543414206524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
